<title>USA: W. Virginia Housing Development plans refundings.</title>
<headline>W. Virginia Housing Development plans refundings.</headline>
<text>
<p>WEST VIRGINIA HOUSING DEVELOPMENT FUND</p>
<p>				  PUBLIC NOTICE</p>
<p>The West Virginia Housing Development Fund is planning to issue a series of refunding bonds.</p>
<p>The proceeds of the bonds will be used to redeem all outstanding bonds in the 1978 Series A and 1979 Series A Single Family Mortgage Purchase Program.</p>
<p>The redemption will depend upon the issuance of the refunding bonds.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
